<title>CANADA: Canada agency details flaxseed export quality.</title>
<headline>Canada agency details flaxseed export quality.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Canadian Grain Commission on Monday detailed the quality specifications of flaxseed destined for export.</p>
<p>			   FLAXSEED EXPORT QUALITY</p>
<p>Quality specification  Testing Pd. No1 CW  No1 CW High Dockage Dockage pct		Dec 1996     1.7    5.8</p>
<p>			  crop yr to date 1.9    6.1</p>
<p>			  prior crop yr   1.7    6.6</p>
<p>Moisture pct	     Dec 1996     8.6    8.4</p>
<p>			  crop yr to date 7.7    8.2</p>
<p>			  prior crop yr   7.6    7.7</p>
<p>Test Weight Kg/hL	Dec 1996    66.0   66.5</p>
<p>			  crop yr to date65.4   66.5</p>
<p>			  prior crop yr  65.9   67.1</p>
<p>Oil Content pct	  Dec 1996    44.9   43.3</p>
<p>(dry moisture basis)crp yr to date 44.5   43.0</p>
<p>			   prior crop yr 44.1   41.9</p>
<p>Protein Content pct    Dec 1996    22.1   21.7</p>
<p>(dry moisture basis)crp yr to date 21.7   22.1</p>
<p>			   prior crop yr 22.0   22.0</p>
<p>CARGOES		    Dec 1996     2	7</p>
<p>			  crop yr to date14     18</p>
<p>			  prior crop yr  46     47</p>
<p>TONNES		     Dec 1996   3,272  76,457</p>
<p>		  crop yr to date    30,041 147,647</p>
<p>		  prior crop yr     108,230 476,757</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras 204 947 3548))</p>
